## Output Format
When you have finalized your implementation, respond with Lean 4 code wrapped in `<code>...</code>` tags.

Your code must start with:
```
import Plausible
import Fvspec.Impl

namespace Fvspec.Spec
open Fvspec.Impl
```

And end with:
```
end Fvspec.Spec
```

Example:
```
<code>
import Plausible
import Fvspec.Impl

namespace Fvspec.Spec
open Fvspec.Impl

theorem x : 1 = 1 := sorry

end Fvspec.Spec
</code>
```